    {
        "content": "<p>circling back, I'm still eager to help with <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/31898\">#31898</a>, and wondered whether I could get a pair of eyes on the <code>[ofPrimitives](https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/39841)</code> PR? <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"387244\">@Yaël Dillies</span>  <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"947360\">@Nikolas Tapia</span></p>",
